  maxHealth: 500
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 12000
  description: The throne was empty for a hundred years. Something patient sat down,
    grew antlers, and lit the pale fire. It has not stood up since, and it will not
    for you.
  tactics: 'The d9 summit, every mechanic at once: two rift-casting Heralds guard
    him (grey bar), then a 150-point ward (blue bar), THEN three phases of ruin -
    dense rings into storm crosses into rift gyres with homing volleys while Riftlings
    pour in. Bank every Aegis and Purge you can carry. There is no trick. There is
    only being good enough. DU BIST GUT GENUUUUUG.'
  displayName: The Pale King
  difficulty: 9
